# Optional native components

Custom C++ components are an explicit escape hatch. The basic app does not
require native application code. Register future components in
`native/components.toml`; do not add a second editable build manifest. Each
declared component owns a project-local C or C++ source file and must declare
either an explicit browser fallback or a separate Wasm source. The native
module may include only the versioned `<vellum/components/abi.h>` framework
header.
